@title Help popups: EMC check, Bench output and Ask Claude windows
@area Windows
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text EMC check
key enter
wait 10
shot emc
click 141 258
wait 5
shot emc-popup-open
key Escape
wait 3
key Escape
key ctrl+k
text Bench output
key enter
wait 10
shot bench
tree Help
key Escape
key ctrl+k
text Ask Claude
key enter
wait 10
shot ask-claude
tree Help
